  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 77be8d3abc4d614408c62dfb3862c314, type: 3}
  m_Name: J1_Seq2_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SpeakerTextSO
  showScore: 0
  dialogues:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: The client selected your company to proceed based on your budget, and the
      design team has produced RIBA Stage 4 drawings for tender issue.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: The project is split up into packages of work that will be carried out
      by different subcontractor specialists.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: Members of your construction, design, commercial, and planning teams sit
      down to review the drawings to write scope of works for the supply chain to
      price.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: 'The team finds most packages of work are easy to understand and the scopes
      of works could be written by the internal team, though it would be very time
      consuming and labour intensive.

'
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: The team also finds that some of the larger and more complicated packages
      of work are unclear on what is required.
